msgid "API writing guidelines"
msgstr "文档编写规范"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This page explains how to write the class reference. You will learn where to "
"write new descriptions for the classes, methods, and properties for Rebel "
"Engine's built-in node types."
msgstr ""
"本页面将介绍如何编写类参考手册。你会学到去哪里为 Godot 内置节点类型的类、方"
