"带来积极的一面:"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Be part of the community.** The best way to contribute to Rebel Toolbox "
"and help it become ever better is simply to use the Rebel Engine and promote "
"it by word-of-mouth, in the credits or splash screen of your games, blog "
